00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.180
TURNS!

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.350
<i>Due to Gym Ghingnham and his Turn X's dealings...</i>

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:29.730
<i>I find myself battling against him on the Lunar Surface.</i>

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:33.730
<i>But, I now understand why Queen Dianna has opened the archive to the Dark History.</i>

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:41.660
<i>And in this way, due to the Turn A's data being revealed, I came to understand the true capabilities of the White Doll.</i>

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:50.210
<b>A New Enemy</b>

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:26.160
If you had already understood what the true meaning of the Dark History was...

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.040
...Why did you permit the Gym Ghingnham lineage to move ahead and do what it wished?

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:34.380
The Turn A's true function was only revealed to us once we had already collected the research data from the Turn X.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:38.340
Without making use of Ghingnham's power, we would have never understood all of this!

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:43.850
Sir Guin, it's hard to imagine these mechanical doll wars leading to our total destruction.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:47.560
Well, easing the tensions in these current battles is my responsibility.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.480
This is the enemy's territory!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.150
However, Dianna Soriel...

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.860
...are you not my ally?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:54.940
Sir Guin?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.780
What are you thinking?

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:01.070
I, the current ruler of the moon, Dianna Soriel, will now give you an order, Agrippa Maintainer!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:05.580
You will pass on my order to have Gym Ghingnham immediately cease all conflicts outside this place!

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.160
Furthermore, any spy related behavior...

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:12.170
...which you have ordered your officers on Earth and within Dianna Counter to conduct, will cease at once!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.250
That may cause Dianna Counter to collapse.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:19.970
You may simply use my name again to dismantle the Dianna Counter army.

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:25.760
And you really think that the people fighting on Earth will heed your calls now?

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:26.760
What?

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:30.140
Those people have now been awakened to their fighting instincts.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.060
You really don't want to abandon your administrative position, do you?

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:37.070
No... I think Agrippa may be right about that.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.570
You mean about the "fighting instincts"?

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:42.360
It concerns me.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:47.370
Even 300 years ago, I was also opposed to Queen Dianna's plans to return to the Earth.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:49.080
300 years in the past?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.870
Yes, that's correct.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.970
There's no way that I'll ever allow you to destroy the Moon's cities!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.050
The White Doll may be shouldering such sins....

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.770
But they're not related to me!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.480
I would never use it in such a way!

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.150
Based on the data that we observed from the Turn X...

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:23.070
It would appear as though a Pandora's Box has now been opened.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:29.080
This key seems to be the Return Plan's initiation which resulted in all the fighting that's occurring down on Earth!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.160
That's only your own opinion!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:37.040
The Moonrace will not be able to survive forever under Maintainer's current ideals!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:41.960
The House of Maintainer's hibernation capsules have been proven to greatly prolong one's life expectancy!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:46.260
The Terrans, without ever using such technology, can also claim to have lived a two thousand year history!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:49.470
The Earth and the Moon have nothing to do with one another, Dianna Soriel!

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.970
They most certainly do!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:54.640
Even when one ignores Queen Dianna's interventions, people from the earth will still reach to the moon.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:59.150
No, this has already happened because of men like Guin Rhineford!

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.360
What do you mean, like me?

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:06.660
I simply wished to use the moon's technology to fuel the birth of a new technological revolution.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.570
That might be Guin's intentions...

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:12.950
But given another thousand years or less, warriors from earth will also gain the ability to fly to the moon.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:16.960
And that is exactly why we have things like the House of Ghingnham!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:21.960
Perhaps it's because those on earth have retained instinctual memories of the disaster in the past.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.050
Those inhibited their scientific advancements.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:27.970
Genganam is rioting! Genganam is in an uproar!

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.050
Riots?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.970
In Genganam? How can that be?

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:33.270
The citizens started it?

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:36.270
The people have begun to gather just outside the Palace.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:40.940
Unfortunately, this could lead to the Mechanical Dolls from the port launching, Lieutenant.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:41.940
I understand.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.860
I'll pursue the Mahiroo troops all the way to the port...

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.860
If you'll control the rioting taking place here.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.740
Now that they've seen those images, these riots couldn't be helped.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.750
Colonel Michael, the rest is yours!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:56.960
I'll take care of these rioters.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.040
Then I will head for the port and deal with the Mahiroo!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.750
The Royal Guard even took off!

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.840
Do not allow the rioters to get inside the palace!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.640
If you launch in the Mahiroo while they're in Emergency standby, it will be considered a felony!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.480
There's a riot going on!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.060
Obviously, now isn't the time for peace!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.440
Just follow along after me.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.150
You bastard...

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:28.780
What the?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.070
Did you not just witness the images from the Dark History?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:38.250
The Dark History has shown me our world's filled with traditions of soldiers who fought to distinguish themselves, like me!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.870
How could you misinterpret it so badly?

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:44.250
Listen, Jacop. Be sure not to fire off the Rocket Boosters.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.340
The people have gathered directly under the Willgem's Tail!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:50.180
Our Militia may be defending Dianna's castle...

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.970
...but that could lead to us taking possession of it.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.970
Well, it may, depending on the next move Lieutenant Harry makes.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.350
Back off, or we'll be forced to open fire!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.860
Please, allow me to see my son...

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.860
Does this mean a war's broken out on earth?

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.150
- It's merely data projected from the data room, just data!
- Think of it as a movie!

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.860
We're done with this war!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.750
The soldiers have opened fire!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.040
This fear of the Dark History alone has affected all of these people!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:29.050
Imagine how they will react if they were to see the truth about the Turn A!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.050
Enough of your wild interpretations!

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:34.760
Agrippa, it's the policies that you enforced here that left the population feeling so uneasy!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.640
Even when taking that into consideration...

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.770
People shouldn't be troubled by events from over two thousand years ago.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:44.650
Furthermore, consider the fact that this "Universal Century", began a little over ten thousand years ago.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:49.570
Lord Agrippa had promised to show me many different wonderful things... These can't be it, can they?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.360
Don't change the subject!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:57.740
Our own history has progressed smoothly, without ever having to expose the House of Ghingnham to a single battle like this one.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.950
That man wouldn't stop his rambling for anything...

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.960
And because of that, you'd permit the Ghingnham family to provoke a real battle?

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.960
Make sure you leave us a Borjarnon!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:11.670
I withheld the Dark History from the Moonrace with the intention of allowing them to live in peace!

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.180
However, the Queen...

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.340
The Terrans have begun to awaken themselves to the world.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.560
It will no longer be possible to ignore history.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.640
You're saying this because your own fighting instincts have awakened!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.640
And because of that, we have no choice but to remove...

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.560
Anybody who displays signs of those fighting instincts!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.360
Of course you, Agrippa, have not yet displayed these instincts.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.360
And because you yourself treacherously define them...

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.280
...It would be impossible to change your viewpoint.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:40.450
During my time on earth, I learned a lot of things about life, death, and war.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:44.250
Now I realize... Perhaps I did commit a sin 300 years ago.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.880
If that's the case, we can commit one more right here and now!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.170
We will show the people of earth...

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.170
...just how pathetic the Moonrace can be once they've lost their fragile control.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:04.350
Did I get it?

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.980
Dianna?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.860
- Forgive us!
- Forgive us!

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:09.940
Midgard!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:12.280
...Midgard...?

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.860
Midgard?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.370
- Midgard?
- I have to agree with her majesty now.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.750
I understand now that Agrippa was wrong.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.370
Because of this...

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:31.460
His death shall now be my sin, if only because it will restore the balance of the moon's system.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:35.760
However, Agrippa's accusations towards the Queen were not misplaced.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.340
I admit this.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:42.640
Yes, you have indeed brought misfortune upon the moon's system.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.480
And you were willing to stain your hands with murder.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.770
I hope you see such a choice as my final display of loyalty.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.770
If you wish to bring true stability to the moon...

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.860
Then my punishment for this act will also become a necessity.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.150
Prepare yourself!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.160
I am Dianna Soriel!

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.950
After him!

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.580
Your judgment will be lenient.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.870
Please be at ease.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.750
Miss Lily Borjarno?

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.880
Take your people and leave this place.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.170
Release me!

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.670
Ouch, it's still hot...

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.050
I heard the gunshot...

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.180
Agrippa!?

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.760
I.. wasn't the one who shot Agrippa...

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.970
So I see.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.140
Are you hurt?

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:29.560
I'm not. We're fine.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:32.650
We owe the Queen of the moon yet again, I see.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.360
Right, I'll keep that in mind.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.860
I have now realized that this is a world that's meant for soldiers!

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.370
You low life! If you believe that, then I'll have to beat you into the ground!

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.660
You can't do that here in Genganam!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:49.040
- Go back to where you came from, Earthlings!
- We don't want more Dark History!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.750
Alright! We'll get rid of them this way!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.960
Fire warning shots at the people inside the palace!

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.840
Is that a good idea?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.050
Bring us around to the Winter Palace when our path's clear!

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:01.050
Understood.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:04.350
Man, these people must think we're real bastards...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:12.730
Even if the White Doll did destroy the world, it was because of the people using it, right?

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.960
Is THIS what the Turn A is?

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.050
You... What the?

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.930
Why are you holding me back, Gym Ghingnham?

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.560
You're a fool, Merrybell.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:52.440
That thing's the true Turn A, the genuine article.

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:55.230
The data we've collected has made that clear.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:58.530
The real one is far more interesting than some simulation game...

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.030
Don't shoot.

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:10.330
If you try and shoot down the Mahiroo, you might end up causing damage to the Winter Palace!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.830
We haven't seen the enemy Mahiroo make any hostile moves...

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:15.540
Are they heading to the Gendarme?

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:19.760
Here it comes...

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:24.550
Don't shoot it! They're Moonrace. Therefore they understand the significance of this place.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.350
Miashei, don't fire at them!

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:29.430
Prepare to board the Willgem!

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.560
Come on!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.940
Could that be Dianna Soriel!?

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.440
Then the rumors that she's returned are true?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.860
Hey, what should we do?

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.860
We can't follow Lieutenant Sutero's orders...

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.030
And we haven't had any contact with the General...

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:49.950
Let's lure the Terran ship outside and attack it there!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:58.130
Sochie, please avoid any Mobile Suit combat in this region!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:01.460
There are about 10,000,000 people hibernating in that dome!

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:03.920
I would prefer that, but I don't know if they'll agree.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:07.840
Sochie, Are you sure you should be speaking to Queen Dianna that way?

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.430
That was Dianna?

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.850
Well, it doesn't matter, since you both seem to be my sister now!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.140
She's as upbeat as ever, isn't she?

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:20.940
However, I'm having doubts about how far I can trust you and your people, Guin.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.360
Is that true?

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:27.530
I simply wish to use the moon's technology to peacefully advanced the earth's civilization.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.240
That is all.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.450
Of course, we'll discuss that matter when we reach earth in one piece.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.540
Have you been able to establish contact with the Gendarme?

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:41.460
Yes! They're docked at Dianna's port.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.760
We'll move her as far into this region as we're able.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:44.840
That's impossible!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:47.550
The Terrans seem to be on top of things.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.060
This is the route that leads to the Winter Palace!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.350
Give it up, Sutero!

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.230
Not until I'm satisfied!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.850
You're ruining the landscaping!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.730
Sochie, where have you gone?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.940
Colonel Michael!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.950
What exactly am I expected to do here?

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.530
They ask us not to fight, but the enemy is already fighting with us...

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.740
...so what are we supposed to do?

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.040
Even my Kapool can use something like this!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.960
What's the situation? What of Genganam?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.130
Without being able to use weapons, both sides are struggling right now.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.420
Really...

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.840
And what has become of the riot?

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.140
It's apparently spreading throughout the city.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.260
What's this?

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:33.260
Lieutenant Harry wanted us to give this to you.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:35.850
- You can change into it.
- And our plan?

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.730
Will you change now?

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.150
Can we take Willgem into the city?

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.440
Not at this moment.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.940
Sid, forgive me...

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:46.530
But I'd like for you to take a group of people into the Winter Palace...

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.650
...and make a copy of all of the information from the Dark History.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:54.030
But that's... Are you asking me to go in there and steal their records?

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:58.040
Don't you agree that it's worth it for the Earth's future?

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.120
A Kapool!?

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.250
Stay out of the way, Lieutenant!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:11.130
You little brat! Using a melee weapon like that...

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:14.930
-  You fool!
- Why you!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.350
Wh...What the?

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.730
Scissors will never beat rock, dumbass.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.150
Curse you...!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.730
There you are!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.740
I'll rip that Mustache right off your face!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.950
Your opponent was me!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.830
Milady, please stand aside...

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.040
This man is with the Ghingnham Squadron!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.250
I know you like using cheap tricks Earthlings...

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.640
The palace!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.850
Is this place really going to be safe!?

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.650
The Moonrace should know to never battle here!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.730
Death will end up following a man like him...

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:12.240
Is it alright for us not to help him?

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.320
We won't be lending our assistance.

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:18.950
So, If he asks us, give him some reason why we're unable to.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:22.250
I'll go handle my unit's maintenance!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:32.340
I will overlook this if you will withdraw immediately and without question!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:35.840
Otherwise, be aware that this place is Queen Dianna's Winter Palace!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.930
Damn you Midgard...

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.930
You dare bring a battleship down here!?

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.230
The cause of these riots...

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:50.730
is Lieutenant Harry Ord and the Terrans he's dragged here!

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:53.030
Ready all of our missiles!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.030
This will end up damaging the Palace!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:58.320
I didn't order you to attack the dome with the hibernation capsules!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:01.950
But in order to create a new world, we may have to sweep away the remnants of the old!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:05.250
What could the Gendarme want from this?

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:08.460
Loran, tell the Militia's mobile suits to withdraw at once!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.340
What do you intend to do, Lieutenant?

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.340
Just withdraw!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.130
Sochie, we're retreating!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.630
Wait...Why can't the Willgem back off?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.430
We can't leave this place without Uncle Sid!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:19.550
What're they doing!?

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:21.140
Fire!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.520
Loran, help me out!

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:32.150
Is that some kind of barrier?

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.230
The SUMO is...?

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.150
It's a barrier!

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:35.150
A Barrier?

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.030
Their attack can't get through?

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:37.950
The Gendarme's here?

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.030
Yes.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.240
The SUMO?

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.660
But then, what is that light?

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.040
That light's texture...

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:53.920
What's with that curtain of light... is it absorbing the explosions?

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:01.260
DON'T TOUCH THE PALACE!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.230
It's the Mustache!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.650
What's happening here?

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.560
Cut off the attack!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.730
GET AWAY FROM HERE, NOW!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:23.030
Is the White Doll pushing back that battleship?

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:25.040
That's what it looks like is happening...

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.040
Does it really have that much power?

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:29.830
Just like what was written in the Dark History...

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.540
And Sir Harry's SUMO?

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.750
That man's too stubborn to lose.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:38.630
So it's true...

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.260
The Mustached Mobile Suit is indeed the "Turn A"...

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:44.060
The symbolic machine of the Dark History...

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.930
...that destroyed ancient civilization.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.640
That means I...

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.730
I've done the worst thing possible!

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:55.150
I allowed the Dark History's forbidden machine to be reborn!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:57.240
What have I done!?

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.740
Queen Dianna Soriel!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.030
Dianna!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.740
Bring the ship out to the port!

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.450
I can't see the Turn A...

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.250
WHERE'S THE TURN A!?

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:17.340
Lieutenant Harry of the The Royal Guard's... SUMO...

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:20.130
Taste the judgment of Queen Dianna's laws for yourself!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.440
The laws must be obeyed.

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:37.360
At times, these laws may seem cruel.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.650
Yes...

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:41.360
What's happening with the riot in the cities?

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.540
Where has my boy disappeared too!?

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:57.550
To my dear, loving Moonrace...

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.960
What the?

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.340
- Queen Dianna!
- It's Queen Dianna!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:06.850
I must apologize for allowing your insecurity, and I have no good excuse.

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:09.720
However, it was my responsibility as your "Queen Dianna".

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:13.440
What you saw was the miserable history of mankind.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.730
However, that is our heritage as the Moonrace.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:19.030
I wanted all of you to be aware of it.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:24.240
- It was for that reason that I broadcast the data from the Winter Palace.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.860
- That's our Queen Dianna.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:24.240
- Just the sight of you is enough to ease a riot.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.830
It would be ideal if all of our problems could be solved so peacefully...

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.040
We must be aware of it...

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.830
As mankind always has the potential to repeat the Dark History's mistakes.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:36.330
Perhaps that is simply mankind's unavoidable destiny.

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:43.760
However, it is my wish for us to overcome this fate and instead work together to build up a new history.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:49.220
We will show the people of earth that it is everyone's duty!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.640
That person up there is Queen Dianna. The real Queen Dianna.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:59.440
Yes. I take great pride in calling myself her protector and leader of the Royal Guard.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:03.950
And at the same time, Lady Kihel Heim, it has given me the chance to meet someone like you.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.450
Thank you...

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.160
The lady who I must protect, has now become two people.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:13.040
No, perhaps someday this position will let me protect even more.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:15.330
Would that make the men happy?

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:16.830
Yes.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.960
And you will continue to watch only Queen Dianna?

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:23.260
Truthfully, my eyes are actually looking at a different lady right now.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:28.850
Really now? That's why you always wear your red sunglasses, isn't it?

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:31.060
I understand.

00:21:31.060 --> 00:21:34.140
- The Queen already knows about it.
- I realize that.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:41.020
<i>I would also like to relay this to the 10,000,000 Moonrace currently hibernating in the Winter Palace.</i>

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:47.950
<i>From now on, there must be permanent contact between the moon and the earth.</i>

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:56.620
<i>Our ancestors lived life according to nature, grew old, and died naturally. That is how humans should live.</i>

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:03.050
<i>- I think that it is our turn to live in that manner. For this, we must borrow Earth's strength.</i>

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.130
"To live and die according to nature," hmm?

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:02.250
It's a more difficult life than you think.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:08.130
<i>Let our two peoples walk hand in hand together now so that the same mistakes need never be repeated again.</i>

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:14.060
Repeating one's own mistakes is simply another aspect of human nature.

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:15.640
Don't you think so, Merrybell?

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:17.560
Yes, Gym Ghingnham.

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b><i>Yama no ha tsuki wa michi</i></b>

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b>As the full moon, casts itself over the mountain's edge...</b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b><i>iki zuku anata no mori</i></b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b>...it spreads the breath of life spreads into the forest where you stand...</b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b><i>Natsu kusa abite nemuru</i></b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b>As you sleep in the summer grass...</b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b><i>Itooshii yokogao</i></b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b>...your profile is a lovely sight to behold.</b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b><i>Kaze ni</i></b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b>The wind...</b>

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.780
<b><i>LaLaLu... LaLaLu...</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b><i>utae... hane ni</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b>The sight of your wings, is seen...</b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b><i>tsuki utsushi</i></b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b>...in the moon's reflection.</b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b><i>Inochi kagaya kase yo</i></b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b>This wonderful life will shine vividly.</b>

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:43.150
<i>Now that he has obtained the data from the Dark History...</i>

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:47.560
<i>...Sir Guin decides to betray Queen Dianna and throw his hand in with Ghingnham.</i>

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:52.160
<i>I try to stop him, but am blocked by the Turn X...</i>

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:56.160
<i>The only way of escape is to abandon the White Doll and flee.</i>

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:03.170
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...<i>
Guin's Betrayal</i>

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:07.130
"The winds of conspiracy blocks the way."

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:08.500
<b>Guin's Betrayal</b>
